{
  "slug": "magpie",
  "name": "Magpie",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Magpie website intelligence over a hosted MCP server. Free: a single-page audit covering overall score, Core Web Vitals, on-page SEO, security headers, robots/sitemap, and WordPress-aware findings. Pro: rank tracking (Google positions and movement over time) and competitor keyword-gap analysis.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, **4 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `magpie-audit` (Audit a website's health with Magpie — overall score, Core Web Vitals, on-page SEO, security headers, robots/sitemap, and…), `magpie-seo` (Track Google rankings and find competitor keyword gaps with Magpie Pro)\n- **Commands** (4): `audit` (Run a free Magpie website audit (score, Core Web Vitals, SEO, security, WordPress) for a URL), `connect` (How to unlock Magpie Pro — get a key and set MAGPIE_API_KEY), `gap` (Find keywords a competitor ranks for that your site doesn't (Magpie Pro)), `rank` (Track Google search positions for a site and keywords over time (Magpie Pro))\n- **MCP servers** (1): `magpie`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install magpie@claude-community` from `jezweb/magpie` (`plugins/magpie`).",
  "compatibility": [
